{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-22-1","title":"Psalms 22:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David complains in great discouragement. 9 He prays in great distress. 23 He praises God.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2962. B.C. 1042. (Title.) Aijeleth. or, the hind ofthe morning. 16; 42:1,2 my God. 31:14-16; 43:1-5; Mt 27:46; Mr 15:34; Lu 24:44 why hast. 26:9; 37:28; 71:11; 1Sa 12:22; Heb 13:5 far. 11; 16:1 helping. Heb. my salvation. Isa 46:13 words. 32:3,4; 38:8; Job 3:24; Isa 59:11; Lu 22:44; Heb 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-2","title":"Psalms 22:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I cry. 42:3; 55:16,17; 88:1; Lu 18:7; 1Th 3:10; 2Ti 1:3 but. 80:4; La 3:8,44 in the night. Lu 6:12; 18:7; 22:41-46 am not silent. Heb. there is no silence to me. Mt 26:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-3","title":"Psalms 22:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>But. 145:17; Isa 6:3; Re 4:8 that. 50:23; 65:1; De 10:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-4","title":"Psalms 22:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>44:1-7; Ge 15:6; 32:9-12,28; Ex 14:13,14,31; 1Sa 7:9-12 Ro 4:18-22; Heb 11:8-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-5","title":"Psalms 22:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>cried. 99:6,7; 106:44; Jud 4:3; 6:6; 10:10-16 and were. 25:2,3; 31:1; 69:6,7; 71:1; Isa 45:17; 49:23; Ro 9:33; 10:11; 1Pe 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-6","title":"Psalms 22:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I am. Job 25:6; Isa 41:14 a reproach. 31:1; 69:7-12,19,20; 88:8; Isa 49:7; 53:3; La 3:30; Mt 11:19; 12:24 Mt 27:20-23; Joh 7:15,20,47-49; 8:48; Re 15:3; Heb 13:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-7","title":"Psalms 22:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>laugh. 35:15,16; Mt 9:24; 27:29,39; Mr 15:20,29; Lu 16:14; 23:11,35-39 shoot out. Heb. open. 31:18; Job 16:4,10; 30:9-11; Isa 57:4; Mt 26:66-68 shake. 44:14; 109:25; Isa 37:22,23; Mt 27:39,40; Mr 11:29-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-8","title":"Psalms 22:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>He trusted. Heb. rolled himself on. 37:5; 55:22; Pr 16:3; *marg: Mt 27:42,43 let him. 3:1,2; 42:10; 71:11; 91:14; Mr 15:30-32 seeing, etc. or, if he delight. 18:19; Isa 42:1; Mt 3:17; 12:18; 17:5; Lu 23:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-9","title":"Psalms 22:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that took. 71:6; 139:15,16; Isa 49:1,2 thou didst. 71:17; Isa 7:14,15; 9:6 make me hope. or, keep me in safety. Mt 2:13-15; Re 12:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-10","title":"Psalms 22:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>cast. Isa 46:3,4; 49:1; Lu 2:40,52 thou. Joh 20:17 from. Jer 1:5; Ga 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-11","title":"Psalms 22:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Be not. 10:1; 13:1-3; 35:22; 38:21; 69:1,2,18; 71:12; Joh 16:32; Heb 5:7 none to help. Heb. not a helper. 72:12; 142:4-6; De 32:36; Mt 26:56,72,74</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-12","title":"Psalms 22:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Many. 68:30; Jer 50:11 strong. De 32:14,15; Isa 34:7; Eze 39:18; Am 4:1-3; Mt 27:1; Ac 4:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-13","title":"Psalms 22:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>gaped, etc. Heb. opened their mouths against me. 7; 35:21; Job 16:10; La 2:16; 3:46; Mt 26:3,4,59-65 as a. 21; 7:2; 17:12; 35:17; Eze 22:27,28; 1Pe 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-14","title":"Psalms 22:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>I am. Jos 7:5; Mt 26:38; Lu 22:44; Joh 12:27 all. 17; Da 5:6 out of joint. or, sundered. heart. 68:2; Jos 7:5; Job 23:16; Mr 14:33,34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-15","title":"Psalms 22:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>strength. 32:3,4; Pr 17:22 tongue. 69:3,21; Job 29:10; La 4:4; Joh 19:28 into the. 30:9; 104:29; Ge 3:19; 18:27; Job 7:21; 10:9; 34:15; Isa 53:12 Da 12:2; Mt 27:50; 1Co 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-16","title":"Psalms 22:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>dogs. 22:1; *title 20; 59:6,14; Mt 7:6; Php 3:2; Re 22:15 compassed. Lu 11:53,54 assembly. 86:14; Jer 12:6; Mt 26:57; Mr 15:16-20; Lu 22:63-71; 23:4,5,10,11 Lu 23:23 they pierced.The textual reading is {ka�ri,} \"as a lion my hands and feet;\" but several MSS., read {k�roo,} and others {karoo} in the margin, which affords the reading adopted by our translators. So the LXX. [oryxan cheiras mou kai podas,] so also the Vulgate, Syriac, Arabic, and Ethiopic; and as all the Evangelists so quote the passage, and apply it to the crucifixion of Christ, there seems scarcely the shadow of a doubt that this is the genuine reading; especially when it is considered, that the other contains no sense at all. The whole difference lies between [v�v] {wav} and [y�wd,] {yood,} which might easily be mistaken for each other.</p>\n<p>Zec 12:10; Mt 27:35; Mr 15:24; Lu 23:33; Joh 19:23,37; 20:25,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-17","title":"Psalms 22:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I may. 102:3-5; Job 33:21; Isa 52:14 look. Mt 27:36,39-41; Mr 15:29-32; Lu 23:27,35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-18","title":"Psalms 22:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Mt 27:35; Mr 15:24; Lu 23:34; Joh 19:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-19","title":"Psalms 22:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>But. 11; 10:1 O my. 18:1; 21:1; 40:13,17; 69:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-20","title":"Psalms 22:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>soul. 17:13; Zec 13:7 my darling, etc. Heb. my only one from the hand. 35:17 the dog. 16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-21","title":"Psalms 22:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>me from. Lu 22:53; Joh 14:30; 2Ti 4:17; 1Pe 5:8 horns. Nu 23:22; De 33:17; Job 39:9,10; Isa 34:7; Joh 8:59; Ac 4:27 Ac 5:30-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-22","title":"Psalms 22:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>I will. 40:9; 71:18,19; Joh 7:25,26; Heb 2:11,12 my brethren. Mt 12:48,49; 25:40; 28:10; Joh 20:17; Ro 8:29 in the. 25; 40:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-23","title":"Psalms 22:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Ye that. 115:11,13; 135:19,20; 145:19; 1Ch 16:8-13; Lu 1:50 all ye. 105:3-7; 106:5; 107:1,2; 135:19,20 glorify. 50:23; Isa 25:3; Lu 2:20; 1Co 6:19,20; 10:31; Re 15:4 all ye the. 30; 1Ch 16:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-24","title":"Psalms 22:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>For. 6; 35:10; 69:29-34; Isa 50:6-9 neither. Lu 23:46 but. 2; 34:6; 116:3-6; 118:5; Heb 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-25","title":"Psalms 22:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>My praise. 22; 35:18; 40:9,10; 111:1 I will. 56:12; 65:1; 66:13,16; 116:14-19; 118:19,20; Ec 5:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-26","title":"Psalms 22:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>The meek. 69:32; Le 7:11-17; Isa 25:6; 65:13; Joh 6:48-58 they. 105:3,4 your. 69:32; Joh 4:14; 6:51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-27","title":"Psalms 22:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>All the ends. 2:8; 72:8,11; 86:9; 98:3; Isa 45:22; 46:8,9; 49:6,12 turn. Ac 14:15; 20:21; 26:18-20; Ro 16:26; 1Th 1:9 and all. 96:7; 102:22; 117:1; Re 7:9-12; 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-28","title":"Psalms 22:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>47:7,8; Da 7:14; Ob 1:21; Zec 14:9; Mt 6:13; Re 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-29","title":"Psalms 22:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>that be. 73:7; 78:31; Isa 10:16 shall. 45:12; 72:10,11; Isa 60:3-5,16; Re 21:24 all they that. 113:7; Isa 26:19; 29:4; Php 2:10; Re 20:12-15 bow. Isa 45:23; Ro 14:10-12 and none. 49:6-9; Ho 13:9; Joh 3:36; 11:25,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-30","title":"Psalms 22:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>A seed. Isa 53:10; Heb 2:13 it shall. 14:5; 24:6; 73:15; 87:6; Mt 3:9; Ga 3:26-29; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-22-31","title":"Psalms 22:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>They. 78:6; 86:9; 102:18; 145:4-7; Isa 44:3-5; 49:21-23; 54:1; 60:4; 66:7-9 his righteousness. Ro 1:17; 3:21-25; 5:19-21; 2Co 5:21</p>"}]}